    "name": "AIly's Daydream : AI Roomie",
    "steam_appid": 3733980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIly's Daydream: AI Roomie is a gamified AI companion tool. The character in the game is driven by a large language model. You can customize her appearance, set her personality preferences, and define her way of speaking to match the way you want her to be. She has a real 3D avatar, her own independent 3D space, and even shares memories with you from your time together. She's no longer just a large language model that can only output text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the appearance and personality of your AI companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/7ce2fe9dce40fd2dd294c4319add76d0.poster.avif?t=1755758308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/7ce2fe9dce40fd2dd294c4319add76d0.webm?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you interact more deeply with your AI roommate, she will <strong>create memories</strong> that are unique to you and her. Of course, she is not just your companion but also a great assistant for your work and daily life. She can<strong> proactively change the music environment </strong>when you're feeling down. She can also help you record the happy or sad stories of the day. And of course, she can r<strong>emind you of important things</strong> to help you live better in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the room, day/night weather, and ambient sound effects:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/f88e6b9282dc0fda354b102a3954982c.poster.avif?t=1755758308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/f88e6b9282dc0fda354b102a3954982c.webm?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich AI Commands:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can trigger various AI commands in your conversations with your AI companion, allowing you to better utilize the game's features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf you're feeling down during a chat, your AI companion might suggest some cheerful songs and even change the tracks for you~\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhen you need to review some travel-related words you learned today, you can ask your AI companion to write these words into your notes. The next day, through memory, your companion can help you review these words!\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhen you're getting ready for bedtime reading, it can switch to a night-time environment for you.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/81ecbe923a2073b2fcbcac4f520a6a23.poster.avif?t=1755758308\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/81ecbe923a2073b2fcbcac4f520a6a23.webm?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/81ecbe923a2073b2fcbcac4f520a6a23.mp4?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Command List:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch Day/Night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable Ambient Sound Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write Diary Entries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create Tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Alarms</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AIly's Daydream: AI Roomie is a gamified AI companion tool. The character in the game is driven by a large language model. You can customize her appearance, set her personality preferences, and define her way of speaking to match the way you want her to be. She has a real 3D avatar, her own independent 3D space, and even shares memories with you from your time together. She's no longer just a large language model that can only output text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the appearance and personality of your AI companion:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/7ce2fe9dce40fd2dd294c4319add76d0.poster.avif?t=1755758308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/7ce2fe9dce40fd2dd294c4319add76d0.webm?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you interact more deeply with your AI roommate, she will <strong>create memories</strong> that are unique to you and her. Of course, she is not just your companion but also a great assistant for your work and daily life. She can<strong> proactively change the music environment </strong>when you're feeling down. She can also help you record the happy or sad stories of the day. And of course, she can r<strong>emind you of important things</strong> to help you live better in the real world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize the room, day/night weather, and ambient sound effects:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/f88e6b9282dc0fda354b102a3954982c.poster.avif?t=1755758308\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/f88e6b9282dc0fda354b102a3954982c.webm?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich AI Commands:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can trigger various AI commands in your conversations with your AI companion, allowing you to better utilize the game's features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cIf you're feeling down during a chat, your AI companion might suggest some cheerful songs and even change the tracks for you~\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhen you need to review some travel-related words you learned today, you can ask your AI companion to write these words into your notes. The next day, through memory, your companion can help you review these words!\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cWhen you're getting ready for bedtime reading, it can switch to a night-time environment for you.\u201d</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/81ecbe923a2073b2fcbcac4f520a6a23.poster.avif?t=1755758308\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/81ecbe923a2073b2fcbcac4f520a6a23.webm?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733980/extras/81ecbe923a2073b2fcbcac4f520a6a23.mp4?t=1755758308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI Command List:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch Day/Night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable Ambient Sound Effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write Diary Entries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create Tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set Alarms</p></li></ul>",
